  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The azo products obtained have an extended conjugate system having<br />both the aromatic rings joined through the &ndash;N=N&ndash; bond. These compounds<br />are often coloured and are used as dyes. The given diazonium salt couples with 1-naphthylamine&nbsp;to form a red azo-dye.&nbsp;This is an example of electrophilic substitution reaction.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/04b6988c-f3d9-4230-a90a-29fee18ea70c-9a0ea62e-649f-4edf-a938-cff42ef6451a-9894052_3.png\" style=\"width: 804px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
